\f1\b\fs40 1. The Core Viral Platforms\
The TMinusVirus (The Base Weapon)\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Classification:
\f2\b0  Engineered pararetrovirus with variable specificity.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Targeting Mechanism:
\f2\b0  Features an adaptive integrase complex that scans the host genome for highly specific Single Nucleotide Polymorphisms (SNPs), haplotype blocks, or distinct phenotypic markers (e.g., specific melanin density or metabolic pathways).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Non-Target Behaviour:
\f2\b0  Acts as a benign passenger virus. It remains dormant and undetectable by standard immune screening, allowing it to spread silently through social and familial networks.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Target Payload:
\f2\b0  If the genetic target profile matches, a molecular tripwire unlocks transcription. The virus expresses a rapid cytotoxic payload, inducing widespread cellular apoptosis and acute multi-organ failure within 48 hours, mimicking a natural genetic aneurysm.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

