\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Subscription Lifespan Model (Rule 2):
\f2\b0  Because the virus is a pararetrovirus, its genetic payload remains 
\f1\b episomal
\f2\b0 \'97floating freely in the nucleoplasm as separate rings of DNA rather than integrating into host chromosomes. The host cell naturally fights this foreign intrusion through 
\f1\b histone methylation
