\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs40 The Hermann Fallacy\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Hermann completely dismisses this outcome because his data states that any viral concentration high enough to saturate those repair pathways will trigger an immediate, terminal cellular checkpoint. He believes the host will suffer immediate systemic toxic shock, catastrophic anaphylaxis, and liquefied kidneys within minutes. In his mind, the biological engine fails entirely long before chromosomal integration can occur, ensuring the mandatory subscription model remains perfectly un-hackable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
