\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs40 3. Backstory Plot Points & Character Motives\
Janine\'92s Calculated Gamble\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Motivation:
\f2\b0  Janine\'92s daughter, Sarah, suffers from 
\f1\b Limb-Girdle Muscular Dystrophy (LGMD)
\f2\b0 , a progressive, debilitating muscle-wasting disease.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Hypothesis:
\f2\b0  Working on the trials alongside Hermann, Janine realizes his defense models only account for healthy, stable cell tissue. She knows LGMD muscle cells are already trapped in a pathological loop of constant membrane rupture, chronic oxidative stress (causing continuous double-stranded DNA breaks), and frantic, hyper-reconstructive stem cell division (mitosis).\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Execution:
\f2\b0  Janine realizes a temporary dose that fades in a fortnight is useless for a chronic genetic wasting disease. Desperate to permanently cure her daughter, she uses a series of high-concentration 
\f1\b intramuscular micro-injections
\f2\b0  directly into Sarah's wasting limb muscles.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Result:
\f2\b0  Because the localized tissue was already fractured and hyper-dividing, the localized "giga-dose" successfully saturates the cell's repair kinetics 
\f3\i without
\f2\i0  triggering the systemic, lethal anaphylaxis Hermann predicted. Sarah's muscle stem cells (satellite cells) accidentally trap the TPlus code and stitch it directly into her chromosomes during mitosis. Sarah is cured, her upgrades are now permanent and self-sustaining, and Janine stops the dosing program entirely.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

