\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Realization:
\f2\b0  Hardy sends a minion to the lab in the Pale to investigate the TPlus project. Upon receiving the technical brief, Hardy balances the immense humanitarian potential against the global economic reality.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Threat:
\f2\b0  A universal panacea that grants a 160-year lifespan of pristine health would trigger a structural apocalypse: the total collapse of the private medical, pharmaceutical, and health insurance sectors, followed by the instant bankruptcy of global pension systems and real estate markets due to the loss of generational turnover.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Action:
\f2\b0  Hardy decides the discovery is a systemic bomb that must be silenced. He orders the facility in the Pale to be permanently frozen and sealed under a hard security lockdown.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

