\f2\b0  While Janine is finishing her shift in the Pale, Hardy's lockdown executes. The red warning lights activate, the heavy security bulkheads seal, the external data lines go dark, and the lab is permanently quarantined.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
